Hi,

replace 'model.matrix' with 'inla'.

2. In addition, I have a model that includes both patient-level
frailties and spatial (village-level) frailties. But am also getting
this error
>
> Error in model.frame.default(formula = y...fake ~ spatial + patID,
> data = list( :
>   variable lengths differ (found for 'patID')
>
> Definitely, I have number of patients more than village points. Why
> complaining about different lengths?

then you need to replicate the village points, so they all have the
same length. so that each 'row' corresponds to one data-point.

H

