> > if loc is a 2-column matrix of pixel coordinates, and index is an
> > index vector, for each pixel data indexing into the corresponding
> > coordinate row of loc, and t is a vector of corresponding time
> > points for the observations.
> >
> > Adding the higher order harmonics is then just a matter of adding
> > more f() terms to the formula.
> >
> > Finn
