From u573186f7652d8b08 at groups.google.com  Tue Sep 29 12:59:54 2015
From: u573186f7652d8b08 at groups.google.com (Erick Okuto)
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2015 12:59:54 +0000
Subject: Re: [r-inla] Re: Cyclic representation using INLA
Message-ID: <YyPpTlFW9gE.htBksMlaBAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <YyPpTlFW9gE.XbuBCHYIBAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
References: <YyPpTlFW9gE.Mu3uknkiAgAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com> <YyPpTlFW9gE.XbuBCHYIBAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
